# साल and वर्ष both gloss “year” at en.wiktionary.org, which lists them as
# synonyms; CLDR 47 uses वर्ष for the year field.  बरस is the third
# attested word (en.wiktionary, entry “बरस”, with the oblique plural
# बरसों shown in its own usage example).  All three are masculine
# consonant stems, whose oblique plural is -ओं.
साल
सालों
वर्ष
वर्षों
बरस
बरसों
